			<div class="content" id="post-content-1958555">
									

<p>&#8230;goddammit, Smapti. As a thirty-odd year fan of Rush, I'm torn. On the plus side, it's well-written, with references to the band's works interspersed smoothly in the text; <em>Caress of Steel</em> is probably the perfect choice as the vector; and the consequences of outbreak are, as you describe, horrific in their own right. On the other hand, the last bit of the addendum wrecked the gravitas you had going for the whole rest of the article, and, to be honest, choosing thematically-related SCP numbers tends to give me pause.</p>
<p>Then again, &quot;2112&quot; <em>is</em> about suppression of art and individuality, and the end results of both 2112 scenarios are eerily similar. So take my +1, Smapti&#8212; if there's gonna be a 2112 SCP, this needs to be it.</p>

